B.append(eq(10, r"\begin{aligned}t_c&=\int_0^{R_{\max}}\frac{dR}{|\dot R|}=R_{\max}\sqrt{\frac{\rho}{\Delta p_c}}\,C(\chi),\quad x=R/R_{\max},\quad\chi=SR_{\max},\\ C(\chi)&=\sqrt{\frac32}\int_0^1\sqrt{\frac{x^3(1+\chi x)}{1-x^3}}\,dx,\\ C'(\chi)&=\frac12\sqrt{\frac32}\int_0^1\frac{x^{5/2}}{\sqrt{(1-x^3)(1+\chi x)}}\,dx>0\quad(\chi\ge0).\end{aligned}",
    r"$t_c$ is formal collapse time (s); $R,R_{\max}>0$ are radii (m), $\dot R$ wall velocity (m s⁻¹), $|\ |$ absolute value. $\rho$ is density (kg m⁻³), $\Delta p_c>0$ pressure difference (Pa), $S\ge0$ neighbor sum (m⁻¹). $x\in[0,1]$ is dimensionless integration radius and $\chi\ge0$ interaction strength. $C$ and $C'=dC/d\chi$ are dimensionless; integrals are convergent improper integrals at $x=1$.",
    r"$t_c$ 为形式塌缩时间（s）；$R,R_{\max}>0$ 为半径（m），$\dot R$ 为壁速（m s⁻¹），$|\ |$ 为绝对值。$\rho$ 为密度（kg m⁻³），$\Delta p_c>0$ 为压差（Pa），$S\ge0$ 为邻距和（m⁻¹）。$x\in[0,1]$ 为无量纲积分半径，$\chi\ge0$ 为相互作用强度。$C$ 及 $C'=dC/d\chi$ 无量纲；积分在 $x=1$ 处为收敛广义积分。",
    "Collapse-time quadrature and sign check", "timescale", ["t_c radial event time", "R_max, R; x = R/R_max", "χ = S R_max", "C(χ), C′(χ) > 0", "ρ / Δp_c sets time scale", "Ṙ inward speed; |Ṙ| positive"],
    ["x = 1 endpoint behaves as (1 − x)^−1/2", "χ = 0 recovers the Rayleigh coefficient"], "Shared-liquid interaction increases this constrained collapse time.", "共享液体相互作用使这一约束塌缩时间增加。"))
B.append(P(
    "The upper-endpoint singularity is an integrable inverse square root. The differentiated integrand is positive with the same endpoint behavior. This supports differentiation and monotonicity. Zero interaction recovers Rayleigh coefficient 0.9146813565. Use radius 30 μm, pitch 200 μm, density 1000 kg m⁻³ and pressure 100 kPa. Radius/separation is 0.15. These leading-order controls have no certified approximation error.",
    "上端点为可积的平方根反比奇异性。求导后的被积函数为正且具有相同端点形式，支持求导与单调性。零相互作用恢复瑞利系数 0.9146813565。采用半径 30 μm、节距 200 μm、密度 1000 kg m⁻³、压差 100 kPa。半径／间距为 0.15。这些主阶对照未给出经认证近似误差。"))
