B.append(P(
    "Step 6 — Include pair terms in shared-liquid energy. Green’s identity converts the interaction integral to the cavity boundary. Liquid-domain outward normal points into the cavity. Outward wall speed gives negative liquid-normal velocity. Two negative boundary factors yield positive cross energy for synchronized motion.",
    "步骤 6——共同液体能量中计入成对项。格林恒等式将相互作用积分转至空腔边界。液域外法向指向腔内。向外壁速给出负液域法向速度。同步运动的两个负边界因子产生正交叉能量。"))
B.append(eq(11, r"\begin{aligned}b_i&=R_i^2\dot R_i,\quad \phi_i=-b_i/r_i,\quad K_N\simeq\frac{\rho}{2}\sum_{i,j=1}^{N}\int_\Omega\nabla\phi_i\cdot\nabla\phi_j\,dV,\\ \int_\Omega|\nabla\phi_i|^2\,dV&\simeq4\pi b_i^2\int_{R_i}^\infty r_i^{-2}\,dr_i=4\pi R_i^3\dot R_i^2,\\ \int_\Omega\nabla\phi_i\cdot\nabla\phi_j\,dV&\simeq\int_{\Gamma_j}\phi_i\partial_n\phi_j\,dA\simeq(-b_i/d_{ij})(-\dot R_j)4\pi R_j^2=\frac{4\pi b_ib_j}{d_{ij}}\quad(i\ne j),\\ K_N&\simeq2\pi\rho\sum_i R_i^3\dot R_i^2+4\pi\rho\sum_{i<j}\frac{b_ib_j}{d_{ij}}=2\pi\rho NR^3(1+SR)\dot R^2,\\ K_N&=\frac{4\pi N}{3}\Delta p_c(R_{\max}^3-R^3)\quad\text{in the leading symmetric model},\\ E_{B,\mathrm{tot}}&=N\frac{4\pi}{3}\Delta p_c R_{\max,N}^3=\frac{4\pi}{3}\Delta p_c R_*^3,\quad R_{\max,N}=R_*N^{-1/3}.\end{aligned}",
    r"$K_N$ is leading cluster liquid kinetic energy (J); $N$ count and $i,j$ site indices. $R_i,R_j$ are site radii, $r_i$ radial distance from $i$, $d_{ij}$ center separation, $R$ common radius, $R_{\max}$ its initial maximum, $R_{\max,N}$ fixed-total-work maximum and $R_*$ isolated reference radius (all m); dots are time derivatives. $b_i,b_j$ are source strengths $R_i^2\dot R_i,R_j^2\dot R_j$ (m³ s⁻¹); $\phi_i,\phi_j$ source potentials (m² s⁻¹), $\Omega$ liquid domain and $\Gamma_j$ bubble boundary. $\nabla$ gradient, $\partial_n$ liquid-outward normal derivative, $dV,dA,dr_i$ volume/area/radial elements (m³, m², m), $\int$ volume/surface/radial integral and $\sum$ finite sum; $i<j$ counts each unordered pair once; $|\ |$ is vector norm and $\infty$ the far radial endpoint. $S$ equal reciprocal-distance sum (m⁻¹), $\rho$ density (kg m⁻³), $\Delta p_c$ pressure difference (Pa), $E_{B,\mathrm{tot}}$ fixed initial work (J), $\pi$ dimensionless. Far separation justifies retaining self and leading pair integrals; $*$ labels a reference.",
    r"$K_N$ 为首阶气泡群液体动能（J）；$N$ 为数量，$i,j$ 为位点编号。$R_i,R_j$ 为位点半径，$r_i$ 为至 $i$ 的径距，$d_{ij}$ 为中心间距，$R$ 为共同半径，$R_{\max}$ 为其初始最大值，$R_{\max,N}$ 为固定总做功最大半径，$R_*$ 为孤立参考半径（均为 m）；点为时间导数。$b_i,b_j$ 为源强度 $R_i^2\dot R_i,R_j^2\dot R_j$（m³ s⁻¹）；$\phi_i,\phi_j$ 为源势（m² s⁻¹），$\Omega$ 为液体域，$\Gamma_j$ 为泡边界。$\nabla$ 为梯度，$\partial_n$ 为液体外法向导数，$dV,dA,dr_i$ 为体积／面积／径向微元（m³、m²、m），$\int$ 为体积／表面／径向积分，$\sum$ 为有限求和；$i<j$ 将各无序对计一次；$|\ |$ 为向量范数，$\infty$ 为径向远端。$S$ 为相同距离倒数和（m⁻¹），$\rho$ 为密度（kg m⁻³），$\Delta p_c$ 为压差（Pa），$E_{B,\mathrm{tot}}$ 为固定初始做功（J），$\pi$ 无量纲。充分分离使保留自身及首阶两泡积分成立；$*$ 标记参考。",
    "Leading-model energy check and fixed-total-work comparison", "energy", ["N, i, j bubble count/indices", "R_i, R_j, R, R_max, Ṙ_i, Ṙ_j, Ṙ", "r_i, d_ij radial/center distances", "b_i, b_j monopole strengths", "φ_i, φ_j; ∇φ gradients", "Ω, Γ_j liquid domain/bubble surface; ∂ₙ", "K_N = self + pair energy; ρ, S", "Δp_c pressure-work reservoir", "E_B,tot fixed total work", "R_max,N = R_* N^−1/3", "∫, Σ, dV, dA, π; * reference label"],
    ["Interaction raises effective inertia, not initial energy", "Fixed per-bubble radius increases total available work"], "The integrated trajectory conserves the leading energy budget.", "积分轨迹守恒首阶能量预算。"))
B.append(P(
    "The inverse-square integral gives reciprocal lower radius. The infinity endpoint vanishes. A distant harmonic source is nearly constant over the emitting surface. Ordered cross terms appear twice; unordered pairs therefore carry coefficient four. Identical sums give bubble count × neighbor sum/2. Inserting Eq. (C3-E09) cancels the interaction factor and recovers pressure work. At fixed total work, take the positive cube root. From isolated radius 30 μm, three, four and five radii become 20.80084, 18.89882 and 17.54411 μm. At 200 μm pitch, times are 2.05687, 1.89946 and 1.77980 μs. Smaller cavities explain the shorter times. Stronger jets and improved optical efficiency remain unestablished.",
    "平方反比积分给出下限半径的倒数，无穷远端点为零。远处调和源在发射球面上近似恒定。有序交叉项出现两次，故无序气泡对的系数为四。相同邻居和给出气泡数 × 邻居距离和／2。代入式（C3-E09），约去相互作用因子并恢复压力功。总功固定时取正立方根。孤立参照半径为 30 μm 时，三、四、五气泡半径分别为 20.80084、18.89882、17.54411 μm。200 μm 节距下，时间为 2.05687、1.89946、1.77980 μs。空腔变小解释时间变短。更强射流及更高光学效率尚未确立。"))
B.append(P(
    "A center-and-four-arm cross has unequal neighbor sums. With arm length equal to pitch, the center sum is four/pitch. The outer sum is (one + one half + √two)/pitch. Their radii therefore cannot share the same history. Homogenization requires averaging length above pitch and below macroscopic variation length. Volume fraction leaves that separation unresolved.",
    "中心加四臂十字形具有不同邻居和。臂长等于节距时，中心和为四／节距，外点和为（一 + 二分之一 + √二）／节距。因此其半径不能采用共同历程。均匀化要求平均长度大于节距且小于宏观变化长度。体积分数不能确定该尺度分离。"))
B.append(eq(12, r"\begin{aligned}\phi_b&=\frac{\sum_{i=1}^{N_b}V_i}{V_\Omega},\quad V_i=\frac{4\pi}{3}R_i^3,\quad\phi_b\big|_{\mathrm{cubic}}=\frac{4\pi R^3}{3s^3},\\ \phi(\boldsymbol x,t)&\simeq-\sum_i\frac{\dot V_i(t-r_i/c)}{4\pi r_i},\qquad p'(\boldsymbol x,t)\simeq\sum_i\frac{\rho}{4\pi r_i}\ddot V_i(t-r_i/c).\end{aligned}",
    r"$\phi_b$ is dimensionless instantaneous bubble-volume fraction; $V_i$ bubble volume and $V_\Omega>0$ representative-region volume (m³), $N_b$ bubble count, $R_i,R,s$ radius/common cubic-lattice radius/pitch (m), $\pi$ dimensionless. $\phi(\boldsymbol x,t)$ is weak far-field potential (m² s⁻¹), $p'$ pressure disturbance (Pa), $\boldsymbol x$ observation position (m), $t$ time (s), $r_i>0$ distance to source $i$ (m), $c$ sound speed (m s⁻¹), $\rho$ density (kg m⁻³). Dots on $V_i$ are volume time derivatives (m³ s⁻¹, m³ s⁻²); $t-r_i/c$ is retarded time. $\sum$ sums sources; $\simeq$ is a distant, compact, weak-source approximation.",
    r"$\phi_b$ 为无量纲瞬时气泡体积分数；$V_i$ 为泡体积、$V_\Omega>0$ 为代表区体积（m³），$N_b$ 为泡数，$R_i,R,s$ 为半径／立方晶格共同半径／间距（m），$\pi$ 无量纲。$\phi(\boldsymbol x,t)$ 为弱扰动远场势（m² s⁻¹），$p'$ 为压力扰动（Pa），$\boldsymbol x$ 为观察位置（m），$t$ 为时间（s），$r_i>0$ 为至源 $i$ 的距离（m），$c$ 为声速（m s⁻¹），$\rho$ 为密度（kg m⁻³）。$V_i$ 上的点为体积时间导数（m³ s⁻¹、m³ s⁻²）；$t-r_i/c$ 为延迟时间。$\sum$ 对源求和；$\simeq$ 为远距、紧致、弱源近似。",
    "Volume-fraction definition and retarded monopole approximation", "array", ["V_i, R_i: bubble sites", "V_Ω representative region", "φ_b = ΣV_i / V_Ω", "s, R: cubic-cell geometry", "r_i → observation x", "p′, φ at time t", "ρ, c; V̇_i, V̈_i; t − r_i/c"],
    ["Planar arrays require a declared layer thickness", "Activation and propagation delays affect overlap", "Weak far-field sources do not predict impact pressure"], "A spatial sum needs source histories and travel times, not only site count.", "空间求和需要源历程及传播时间，不能只给位点数。"))
B.append(P(
    "Step 7 — Use retarded time for a weak compact source. Differentiate far-field potential at fixed observation position to obtain pressure. Bubble volume fraction differs from initial liquid-PFC loading. A planar array needs layer thickness to define region volume. Coupled source histories must be solved before propagation. At 200 μm and 1480 m s⁻¹, travel time is 0.13514 μs. This is short against 3 μs but can exceed nanosecond pulses. Edges, delay and nonlinear shielding remain relevant.",
    "步骤 7——弱紧致源采用延迟时间。固定观察位置求远场速度势时间导数，得到压力。气泡体积分数不同于初始液态 PFC 装载量。平面阵列需层厚才能定义区域体积。传播之前须先求耦合源历程。200 μm、1480 m s⁻¹ 下传播时间为 0.13514 μs，相对 3 μs 很短，却可超过纳秒脉冲。边缘、延迟及非线性屏蔽仍需考虑。"))

