B.append(eq(30, r"\begin{aligned}m_j&=(1000\,\mathrm{kg\,m^{-3}})\frac{\pi(10\times10^{-6}\,\mathrm m)^2}{4}(50\times10^{-6}\,\mathrm m)\simeq3.926991\times10^{-12}\,\mathrm{kg},\\ U_j&=\sqrt{\frac{2(2.00\times10^{-9}\,\mathrm J)}{3.926991\times10^{-12}\,\mathrm{kg}}}\simeq31.91538\,\mathrm{m\,s^{-1}},\\ q_j&\simeq0.5092958\,\mathrm{MPa},\quad p_{\mathrm{rigid,early}}=\rho cU_j\simeq47.23477\,\mathrm{MPa},\\ P_j&=m_jU_j\simeq1.253314\times10^{-10}\,\mathrm{N\,s},\quad P_{\mathrm{tot}}=25P_j\simeq3.133285\times10^{-9}\,\mathrm{N\,s}.\end{aligned}",
    r"$m_j$ is per-jet carrier mass (kg), $\rho=1000$ kg m⁻³ carrier density; $d_j=10\times10^{-6}$ m diameter and $L_j=50\times10^{-6}$ m emitted length supply the first row. $E_j=2.00\times10^{-9}$ J is per-jet kinetic energy; $U_j$ uniform speed (m s⁻¹), $q_j=\rho U_j^2/2$ dynamic pressure and $p_{\mathrm{rigid,early}}$ early rigid-contact pressure (Pa; MPa = 10⁶ Pa). $c=1480$ m s⁻¹ is stipulated sound speed; $P_j,P_{\mathrm{tot}}$ per-jet and total aligned incoming momentum (N s); $\pi$ dimensionless. Uniform direction, full activation and independent cells are assumed.",
    r"$m_j$ 为单射流载液质量（kg），$\rho=1000$ kg m⁻³ 为载液密度；$d_j=10\times10^{-6}$ m 直径及 $L_j=50\times10^{-6}$ m 喷出长度用于第一行。$E_j=2.00\times10^{-9}$ J 为单射流动能；$U_j$ 为均匀速度（m s⁻¹），$q_j=\rho U_j^2/2$ 为动压，$p_{\mathrm{rigid,early}}$ 为早期刚性接触压力（Pa；MPa = 10⁶ Pa）。$c=1480$ m s⁻¹ 为给定声速；$P_j,P_{\mathrm{tot}}$ 为单射流及总对齐入射动量（N s）；$\pi$ 无量纲。假设方向相同、全部激活且单元独立。",
    "Worked finite jet mass, speed and pressure scales", "impact", ["d_j = 10 μm; L_j = 50 μm", "m_j = 3.926991 ng", "E_j = 2 nJ; U_j = 31.91538 m/s", "q_j = 0.509296 MPa", "p_rigid,early = 47.23477 MPa", "P_j, P_tot aligned momentum", "ρ = 1000 kg/m³; c = 1480 m/s; π"],
    ["Carrier mass, not PFC vapor mass, is emitted", "High early pressure does not create additional energy"], "The finite state carried to Chapter 4 includes mass and energy, not only a pressure peak.", "传入第四章的有限状态包含质量及能量，而非只有压力峰值。"))
